{"reviewId": "380402079_80OX9Rp7Q", "review": {"abstract": "被称为建筑业周期或房地产周期）等。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "chapterUid": 12, "content": " 一个库兹涅兹周期大概是15到20年，基本上也是中国从2000年到2020年的房地产周期，也是农村人口向城市人口转移的过程，所以，城市化进程基本上达到了60%，中国这次以房地产拉动的铁公鸡，完成了，所以经济进入了“衰退期”。因为目前还没有找到能代替房地产的新兴行业，虽然新能源是世界领先的，基本上占全球新能源的60%，但是好像还没有发现它能带动中国经济的重新复苏啊", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "7554-7571", "createTime": 1749615054, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80OX9Rp7Q", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 12, "chapterTitle": "07 三周期嵌套 从熊彼特到罗斯托", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 12, "likes": [{"userVid": 37224990, "name": "鹏鹏鹏鹏鹏", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0027-GAYodHaxn6eSmpjwIxH~wf5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [